### Signup user for post list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-list-user@example.com",
  "password": "password1234",
  "nickname": "postListUser"
}


### Login user for post list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-list-user@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}


### Create old post for list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=list-post-old-boundary

--list-post-old-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--list-post-old-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Spring Bean question
--list-post-old-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Manual API check post content.
--list-post-old-boundary--


### Create recent post for list sort check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=list-post-recent-boundary

--list-post-recent-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--list-post-recent-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Recent Spring Bean question
--list-post-recent-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Manual API check recent post content.
--list-post-recent-boundary--


### List posts with default first page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=10


### List posts by keyword
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?keyword=Spring&page=0&size=10


### List posts by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?categoryId=1&page=0&size=10


### List posts by keyword and category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?keyword=Spring&categoryId=1&page=0&size=10


### List posts with invalid page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=-1&size=10


### List posts with invalid size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=0


### List posts with missing category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?categoryId=999999&page=0&size=10


